# -------------------------------
# Commit Title (one line summary)
# Example: [Add] New exploration mods
# -------------------------------

[Category] Short summary

- Detail 1
- Detail 2

[Todo] Short summary
- Planned change 1
- Planned change 2

# -------------------------------
# Categories you can use:
# [Add]     New mods, datapacks, configs, features
# [Fix]     Bug fixes, crashes, incompatibilities, config errors
# [Change]  Balance tweaks, recipe edits, progression adjustments
# [Update]  Updated mods/datapacks/configs
# [Remove]  Removed mods, features, or redundant configs
# [Misc]    Documentation, repo structure, or non-gameplay stuff
# [Todo]    Planned fixes, future content, balance changes
# -------------------------------

# -------------------------------
# Example1:

# [Add] Expanded tech progression
# - Added Create: Steam 'n' Rails for train mechanics
# - Added More Red for extra redstone utilities
#
# [Fix] Early-game recipe conflicts
# - Fixed conflicting wood-to-stick recipes
# - Adjusted stone tool recipe overlap with Tetra
#
